# Test 24 Comparison
# Reduce reduce conflict in SLR and LALR; LALR merges two states with one core
# CLR 14 states with no conflict; only CLR parses the input correctly
CONFLICT SLR reduce/reduce
CONFLICT LALR reduce/reduce
TABLE CLR states=14 
!CONFLICT CLR
re:LALR state [0-9]+ is merged CLR states \{ [0-9]+, [0-9]+ \}
RESULT CLR ACCEPTED
RESULT SLR REJECTED
RESULT LALR REJECTED
